# Machine-local Claude overrides. Both filled-in copies belong in ~/.claude/local/
# and must never be committed — the repo ships only the .example templates beside
# them. Ignored here as a backstop: neither file is written to this path in normal
# use, so an appearance means something went wrong, and the denylist in particular
# would be the leak it exists to prevent.
claude/local/config.json
claude/local/commit-denylist.txt

# Built plugin bundles. Reproducible from the tree by devin/package-plugin.sh,
# so there is nothing to gain from committing one.
dist/
